{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1061962-books-updated-to-2nd-edition","id":1061962,"title":"Books updated to 2nd Edition","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-13T13:42:53-07:00","id":1061962,"title":"Books updated to 2nd Edition","content":"Just curious if anyone has a list of books that have been updated for 2nd edition. I'm OCD about &quot;outdated&quot; material. lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/453-megazarak","name":"MegaZarak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar453_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T13:47:10-07:00","id":1061964,"title":"","content":"CofD core, VtR 2e, and Secrets of the Covenants are the only 2e books for Vampire.<br /> <br /> They don't seem to be really updating books so much as just doing new ones with the new rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1692-maina","name":"Maina","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1692_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"724"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T13:49:17-07:00","id":1061965,"title":"","content":"1st Edition books don't get updated to 2nd Edition, though books written for 2nd Edition might cover similar ground to 1st Edition books. Currently, the only 2nd Edition books are the core book and Secrets of the Covenants, though the system for improvised rituals in Blood Sorcery is the same system used by 2nd Edition, save some minor tweaks mentioned in the 2e core book, so it's 2nd Edition in all but name. The Clan books are 90% fluff, and that fluff is still valid, which is why they appear in the 2nd Edition core book's recommended reading list.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-13T13:51:24-07:00","id":1061967,"title":"","content":"Also &quot;Requiem for Regina&quot; in Dark Eras is up to date for 2e. I don't know if they've released that separately yet. A Thousand Years of Night (book about Elders) will be 2e, and that's almost done, but not out just yet. The Julii will reappear in that (!!!) according to Rose.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12981-romulusgloriosus","name":"RomulusGloriosus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"342"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-14T09:41:18-07:00","id":1062336,"title":"","content":"Half Damned is now moved into second draft.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avat